            <div xml:id="d724">

                <pb facs="0949" n="835" sameAs="frus:frus1922v02/pg835"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">861.404/22</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Russian Ambassador</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Bakhmeteff</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <p>The Russian Ambassador presents his compliments to the Honorable, the Secretary
                    of State and has the honor to request to bring to the attention of the President
                    the enclosed letter from Archbishop Alexander, together with an appeal of
                    several high dignitaries of the Eastern Orthodox Church in the United States of
                    America, headed by His Grace Metropolitan Platon, relative to the reported trial
                    of His Holiness Tikhon, Patriarch of Moscow and All the Russias.</p>
                <p>These documents have been received by the Russian Embassy with the request to
                    submit them to the President.</p>
                <closer><dateline rendition="#float-left"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1922-05-15"><hi rendition="#italic">May 15,
                        1922</hi></date>.</dateline></closer>



